{"id":"5defe8d5249da268","group":"90","path":"90/90-ax-diagonal-axiom.md","title":"Diagonalization Axiom","display":"ax-diagonal-axiom — Diagonalization Axiom","type":"axiom","metadata":{"type":"axiom","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-ax-diagonal-axiom","aliases":["90-ax-diagonal-axiom"],"display":"ax-diagonal-axiom — Diagonalization Axiom","depends_on":["[[90-df-provable]]","[[90-df-diagonal-lemma]]","[[90-df-substitution-function]]","[[90-df-godel-numbering]]","[[90-df-numeral]]","[[90-df-formula]]","[[90-df-sentence]]","[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","[[90-df-syntax-interface]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"axiom"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-ax-diagonal-axiom"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-ax-diagonal-axiom</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ax-diagonal-axiom — Diagonalization Axiom"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"00ee901093c12d44\" href=\"?note=00ee901093c12d44\" title=\"90-df-provable\">90-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f57084ad3c1a7029\" href=\"?note=f57084ad3c1a7029\" title=\"90-df-diagonal-lemma\">90-df-diagonal-lemma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7279c20158ac140e\" href=\"?note=7279c20158ac140e\" title=\"90-df-substitution-function\">90-df-substitution-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b86b211a75cf1748\" href=\"?note=b86b211a75cf1748\" title=\"90-df-godel-numbering\">90-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d53b945955293235\" href=\"?note=d53b945955293235\" title=\"90-df-numeral\">90-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"714deb184f73887a\" href=\"?note=714deb184f73887a\" title=\"90-df-sentence\">90-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,g,d,v,T\">\\(S,g,d,v,T\\)</span> 与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"f57084ad3c1a7029\" href=\"?note=f57084ad3c1a7029\" title=\"90-df-diagonal-lemma\">90-df-diagonal-lemma</a> 的环境相同；涉及固定点的可证性是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a> 的有限推导，公式在数码处的取值记法展开为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a> 的自由代入。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (effective arithmetical signature)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (可有效公理化、能表示编码替换函数的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-理论, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"7279c20158ac140e\" href=\"?note=7279c20158ac140e\" title=\"90-df-substitution-function\">90-df-substitution-function</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\\)</span> (恰有指定自由变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-公式类, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-句子类, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"714deb184f73887a\" href=\"?note=714deb184f73887a\" title=\"90-df-sentence\">90-df-sentence</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline n\">\\(\\overline n\\)</span> (Gödel 编码与数码, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"b86b211a75cf1748\" href=\"?note=b86b211a75cf1748\" title=\"90-df-godel-numbering\">90-df-godel-numbering</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>显式前提：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)\\)</span>，取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"f57084ad3c1a7029\" href=\"?note=f57084ad3c1a7029\" title=\"90-df-diagonal-lemma\">90-df-diagonal-lemma</a>；其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(v\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span>，编码、代入函数及其表示公式均使用同一固定环境。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}axiom}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\forall\\varphi(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\\;\n\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\nT\\vdash\\bigl(\\psi\\leftrightarrow\n\\varphi(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}axiom}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\forall\\varphi(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\\;\n\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\nT\\vdash\\bigl(\\psi\\leftrightarrow\n\\varphi(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>这里把对角模式作为公理模式采用；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"34b9d9e028267d9d\" href=\"?note=34b9d9e028267d9d\" title=\"90-thm-diagonal-lemma-formal\">90-thm-diagonal-lemma-formal</a> 则从替换函数的可表示性推出同一模式。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner}\">\\(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner}\\)</span> 是对象语言中的数码，不能省略横线而与元语言编码混同。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本文件是固定点模式的接口，不声称任意编码或任意弱理论都自动满足它。若将该模式作为额外公理原则采用，应明确区分“采用模式”与由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}\">\\(\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}\\)</span> 证明该模式；后者的构造见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-19\" data-note=\"f57084ad3c1a7029\" href=\"?note=f57084ad3c1a7029\" title=\"90-df-diagonal-lemma\">90-df-diagonal-lemma</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"00ee901093c12d44","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-diagonal-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"f57084ad3c1a7029","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-diagonal-lemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-substitution-function","status":"resolved","id":"7279c20158ac140e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-substitution-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b86b211a75cf1748","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"d53b945955293235","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","