函数的 $S$-理论, see [[90-df-substitution-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"4ce2b2789d377e1f","anchor":"ref-14","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}$ (恰有指定自由变量 $v$ 的 $S$-公式类, see [[90-df-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"714deb184f73887a","anchor":"ref-15","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_S$ ($S$-句子类, see [[90-df-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b86b211a75cf1748","anchor":"ref-16","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner$ 与 $\\overline n$ (Gödel 编码与数码, see [[90-df-godel-numbering]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-diagonal-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"f57084ad3c1a7029","anchor":"ref-17","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"显式前提：$\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)$，取 [[90-df-diagonal-lemma]]；其中 $T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S$，$v\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S$，编码、代入函数及其表示公式均使用同一固定环境。","embed":false},{"target":"90-thm-diagonal-lemma-formal","status":"resolved","id":"34b9d9e028267d9d","anchor":"ref-18","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"这里把对角模式作为公理模式采用；[[90-thm-diagonal-lemma-formal]] 则从替换函数的可表示性推出同一模式。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-diagonal-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"f57084ad3c1a7029","anchor":"ref-19","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"本文件是固定点模式的接口，不声称任意编码或任意弱理论都自动满足它。若将该模式作为额外公理原则采用，应明确区分“采用模式”与由 $\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}$ 证明该模式；后者的构造见 [[90-df-diagonal-lemma]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,g,d,v,T","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_S","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex"